Photorealistic cyberpunk user-interface asset: one single wide horizontal push button plate, viewed perfectly straight-on, centered, spanning 88 percent of the image width and about one quarter of its height, isolated on a pure flat black background. Shape: long bar with sharply chamfered cut corners, like military sci-fi hardware. Frame: dark carbon fibre and anodised gunmetal bezel with fine machined edges. A continuous tube of electric cyan neon light runs all the way around just inside the bezel. Small hot magenta accent lights at the far left and right ends. Face: completely blank glossy black glass, slightly domed, with one soft horizontal reflection and a very faint hexagon pattern under the glass. Blade Runner mood, product photography, crisp focus, symmetrical. Absolutely no text, no letters, no symbols, no icons. One object only, no watermark.
